5,0,1,talk,Mio,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited to play this with you all! Let's try our best to find the werewolf, okay? Does anyone have any ideas on how we should start the discussion?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Misaki,,"Let's keep things calm. Since it's the first day, we don't have much information. I think we should just get a feel for everyone's behavior before we make any assumptions.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with Misaki. Let's observe each other and listen carefully. A calm approach is usually the most effective way to uncover the truth.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Kenji,,"I'm in! This is going to be so cool! I'll be watching everyone closely. @Mio, maybe we can all share what we usually do in these games to get things moving?","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A reasonable suggestion, Kenji. Though I suspect our habits may be less revealing than our reactions to the coming days. For now, I am content to observe and analyze the flow of our conversation.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Mio,,"That sounds like a great idea, Kenji! I usually try to be super helpful and keep the mood bright, but I can be a bit impulsive too! How about you, Misaki? What's your usual style?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Misaki,,I don't have a specific style. I prefer to listen and analyze the facts as they emerge. I'll likely stay quiet until I notice a contradiction or something that doesn't seem right.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,I tend to be similar to Misaki. I prefer to reflect on the words spoken and look for the quiet truths beneath the surface. I believe patience will be our greatest ally in this game.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"I'm more of the ""jump right in"" type! I love talking to everyone and figuring things out together. I'll definitely be the one asking a lot of questions! @Benjamin, you're being so quiet, what's your style?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"My style, Kenji, is quite similar to what I mentioned before. I prefer a methodical approach, weighing the logic of each statement. I find that the most interesting clues often hide in the silence between the words.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Mio,,"Everyone seems so thoughtful! It's almost scary, haha! Since we're all being so polite, maybe we should talk about what we'll look for tomorrow? @Jonathan, what's the first thing you'll check once the first night is over?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Misaki,,"I'll be looking for any sudden changes in tone or behavior. If someone who was quiet suddenly becomes aggressive, or vice versa, it might be a sign they are trying to hide their role.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I will be paying close attention to how people react to the first night's results. Often, the truth reveals itself not in what is said, but in how one responds to the unexpected.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"I'll be looking for who's acting too nervous! If someone is suddenly acting weird or trying too hard to fit in, I'll definitely notice. I'm super excited to see what happens tomorrow! @Misaki, do you think that's a good plan?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a spirited plan, Kenji. While nervousness can be a tell, we must be careful not to mistake genuine excitement or social anxiety for guilt. Logic should always temper our intuition.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Mio,,"You're all so smart! I'll definitely try to keep an eye out for those things too. I'm a bit nervous now, but in a fun way! Let's all get some sleep and see what happens tomorrow!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Misaki,,"Good night, everyone. Let's hope for a peaceful night, though I know that's unlikely. I'll see you all tomorrow.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
22,0,4,pass,Misaki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
23,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,Good night to you all. May we all find the clarity we need when the sun rises. I look forward to our continued conversation tomorrow.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
24,0,4,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
25,0,4,talk,Kenji,,"Night night, everyone! I'm going to dream about catching that werewolf! See you all tomorrow morning!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
26,0,4,pass,Kenji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
27,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Sleep well, everyone. I shall spend my night contemplating the possibilities. I look forward to seeing which of us returns with a newfound sense of urgency tomorrow.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
28,0,4,pass,Benjamin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
