35,1,1,talk,Mio,,"Good morning, everyone! I hope you all slept well! I'm so curious to see if anything happened. Does anyone have any clues or feelings they want to share first?","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"Since the Seer has had one night to divine, I'm wondering if anyone has information they're willing to share. @Jonathan, @Benjamin, or @Kenji, do any of you have anything to report?","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Benjamin"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I prefer to keep my findings close for a moment. Revealing too much too early can make the Seer a target. Let us see how others respond to the morning first.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I don't have any secret info, but I'm super curious! @Jonathan, you're being really mysterious. Are you trying to protect the Seer, or are you just playing it cool? I want to know what's up!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, your enthusiasm is as boundless as ever. However, Jonathan's caution is logically sound; a Seer who reveals themselves too quickly often finds their tenure quite brief. Let us allow the conversation to breathe.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Mio,,"I totally get why Jonathan is being careful! It's like a secret mission, right? But I'm dying to know! @Misaki, do you think the Seer should tell us now, or wait until we have more to talk about?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"It depends on the result. If the Seer found the werewolf, sharing it now could be a huge advantage. However, if the result was ""human,"" it might be better to wait and gather more evidence first.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"Misaki makes a valid point. However, the risk of being targeted by the werewolf tonight is a heavy price to pay. I believe it is wiser to observe the group's dynamics a bit longer before I speak.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"Wait, @Jonathan, did you just basically admit you're the Seer?! You said ""before I speak"" and ""the risk of being targeted""! That's a huge hint! Are you really the Seer? Tell us what you found!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, your eagerness to uncover the truth is admirable, but perhaps a bit hasty. Jonathan's phrasing was cautious, yet you've leaped to a conclusion. Let us not rush to label him before he chooses to reveal himself.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Mio,,"Wow, Kenji! You're so fast at catching things! @Jonathan, if you really are the Seer, that's so cool! But please be careful! Do you think you can tell us something without putting yourself in too much danger?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Jonathan, if you are indeed the Seer, please consider the risk carefully. However, if you have a confirmed werewolf, the village needs that information to make an informed vote today. What is your current thought?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I will be honest with you all. I am the Seer. I divined Kenji last night, and he is human. While I feared for my safety, I believe the village benefits more from this certainty now.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"Whoa, really?! You checked me?! That's so awesome, Jonathan! Thanks for letting everyone know I'm a good guy! Now that we know I'm human, who else should we look at? This is getting intense!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a relief to have a confirmed human among us, though I must admit, Kenji's reaction is almost too enthusiastic. @Jonathan, thank you for your courage. Now, who among the remaining three seems most suspicious to you?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Mio,,"I'm so glad Kenji is human! That's a huge relief! But now it's down to me, Misaki, and Benjamin... that's a bit scary! @Benjamin, you're being so analytical, do you have any suspicions?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Misaki"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Misaki,,"@Benjamin, you've been very focused on logic and observing others. While that's helpful, it can also be a way to deflect attention. Do you have any specific suspicions, or are you just analyzing us?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I find Benjamin's approach intriguing, but as Misaki noted, a focus on logic can sometimes serve as a shield. I am currently weighing the subtle cues of both Mio and Benjamin.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Misaki"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"I think Benjamin is being a bit too quiet and calculating! He's always talking about ""logic"" and ""shields."" @Benjamin, why are you so focused on analyzing us instead of just sharing your gut feeling? It's kind of suspicious!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, a ""gut feeling"" is merely a pattern the subconscious hasn't yet articulated. I prefer the articulated version. If my composure seems like a shield, perhaps it is simply because I value precision over performance.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
