68,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Oh no! Benjamin is gone, and Jonathan was attacked! This is getting so scary! I can't believe the werewolf would target the Seer so quickly. Does anyone have any ideas on what to do now?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"The werewolf's target was obvious. By killing the Seer, they've tried to blind us. Since Benjamin was executed and Jonathan was attacked, the werewolf must be either Mio or Kenji. @Mio, @Kenji, what are your thoughts?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Jonathan"",""Mio"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"Wait, what?! @Misaki, why are you only looking at me and Mio? You're the only one left who hasn't been checked or attacked! That's actually way more suspicious! I'm just a human, remember? Jonathan said so!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Mio"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, that's so mean! Why are you narrowing it down to just us? I'm just as confused as Kenji is! @Kenji, you're right, it's really scary that the Seer is gone. We have to be super careful now!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"I'm not being mean, Mio; I'm being logical. Jonathan confirmed Kenji is human, and Benjamin is dead. That leaves only you and me. Since I know I'm human, the werewolf must be you. @Kenji, please think clearly.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Jonathan"",""Kenji"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Misaki, that's not fair! You're just saying you're human because you're the one talking! Anyone can say that! @Mio, don't listen to her, she's just trying to trick us into voting for you! This is totally suspicious!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, you're being so scary right now! You're just deciding it's me without any proof! @Kenji, thank you for having my back! I'm really just a villager, I promise! Misaki, why are you so sure it's me?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Mio, it is a simple process of elimination. Jonathan confirmed Kenji is human. Benjamin is dead. I know my own role. If Kenji is human and I am human, you are the only one left who could be the werewolf.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Jonathan"",""Kenji"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Misaki, you keep saying ""I know my own role,"" but that's exactly what a werewolf would say to sound convincing! You're trying to force us into a corner. @Mio is just as confused as I am! This feels like a trap!","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,4,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, you're making it sound like a math problem, but people aren't numbers! @Kenji is right, anyone can claim to be human. If you're so sure it's me, why are you so aggressive about it? It feels like you're trying to rush us!","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"I am not being aggressive, merely precise. If we trust Jonathan's divination of Kenji, the logic is inescapable. If you are not the werewolf, Mio, then I must be, but I know I am a villager.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Kenji"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,2,4,talk,Kenji,,"@Misaki, you're just repeating the same thing over and over! That's not proof, that's just a story! @Mio is terrified, and you're just pushing her. I can't trust someone who's trying to force a vote like this!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
